# Copy to functions/.env.local (never committed, like every *.local file):
#   cp functions/.env.local.example functions/.env.local
#
# Emulator-only, non-secret parameters. Only the Functions emulator loads .env.local, over .env
# and .env.<alias>; the deploy ignores *.local. Deployed files (.env, .env.<alias>) never select a
# fake provider or set *_EMULATOR* values. Emulator-only secrets go in functions/.secret.local.
#
# Example:
# PAYMENTS_PROVIDER=fake
